# ALX Protocol - Environment Setup

## Local Development

# Your private key (testnet only - never use mainnet key in repo)
PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# RPC Endpoints
BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.base.org
BASE_MAINNET_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org

# Basescan API Key for contract verification
BASESCAN_API_KEY=...

## Security Notes
# ⚠️ NEVER commit actual private keys to version control
# ⚠️ Use separate keys for testnet and mainnet
# ⚠️ Keep mainnet key in secure environment (hardware wallet)
# ⚠️ Rotate API keys periodically